From faccac4bb10da5a4b2c10c3cb51f71a7a31786b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: likailong <likailong5@huawei.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 23:11:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] [BugFix][Spec Decode] Suppress EAGLE page backoff in
 mamba split on PD producer

Scheduler-side companion to the producer drop exemption in the hybrid KV
cache coordinator.

Scheduler._mamba_block_aligned_split backs the last cacheable mamba-align
page off by one block (and, on newer vLLM revisions, shifts the
partial-tail checkpoint boundary) whenever the EAGLE block drop is
active. On a producer this prevents prefill chunks from ending at the
final full-page boundary. In mamba "align" mode the recurrent state of a
page is materialized only across a chunk boundary (copy-on-write in
MambaManager.allocate_new_blocks), so the final full state page stays
unhashed: even with the coordinator fixed, hybrid hits reconcile to the
per-group minimum and the mamba groups report one full page less
(1600-token prompts -> 0 hit, 3200-token prompts -> 1536).

Rather than copy the scheduler method across vLLM revisions, wrap it:
on a pure producer, clear the drop bit for the duration of the original
call and restore it afterwards. vLLM 0.28.x names the bit use_eagle;
newer revisions expose the dedicated use_eagle_block_drop knob, and the
wrapper handles both. The role comes from
self.vllm_config.kv_transfer_config at call time (same source as the
coordinator tag and the neighboring PD consumer split patch), so the
wrapper is installed unconditionally and consumers, kv_both and
standalone instances pass through unchanged.

Verified in an isolated 16xNPU environment with Qwen3.6-27B hybrid
(FullAttention + Mamba align) MTP PD: prefix hits 1600-token prompts
0/0 -> 1536/1536 and 3200-token prompts 1536/3072 -> 3072/3072 across
repeated runs, producer /metrics prefix_cache_hits_total +4608, probe
latency 5.85s -> 0.33s.

Signed-off-by: likailong <likailong5@huawei.com>
---
 .../test_patch_kv_cache_coordinator.py        | 190 +++++++++++++++++-
 vllm_ascend/patch/__init__.py                 |  21 ++
 .../platform/patch_kv_cache_coordinator.py    | 112 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 321 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

